From af2d5130dd493df1315ba146f9392199dc9fa7f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: easymesh-clients <noreply@vcpe.dev>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 11:27:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] bgscan model: load trigger, roam scan on beacon loss,
 roam scan events

A background scan module with the simple module's behaviour plus: while the
current BSS is heard between two levels, its advertised channel utilization
(BSS Load element, refreshed by scans of its channel) above a percentage for
a hold time starts a roam scan and sets roam_load_triggered, so scan results
may move the station above roam_trigger; a roam scan on beacon loss; and
CTRL-EVENT-ROAM-SCAN events with the reason. CONFIG_BGSCAN_MODEL.
